# Pairs with AppRulesSystemOriginOnly. The refusal must come before the store reads the rule; refusing only a
# present rule tells the caller whether it exists.
MODULE: AppsRuleDeleteRevealsPresence
TARGET: AppRulesSystemOriginOnly
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: an operator delete of an absent app-owned rule answers not found
PERTURBS: DeleteAppRule

--- FIND
        Answer(s, pr) == IF ~s THEN "appOwned" ELSE IF pr THEN "removed" ELSE "notFound"
--- REPLACE
        Answer(s, pr) == IF ~s /\ pr THEN "appOwned" ELSE IF pr THEN "removed" ELSE "notFound"
--- END
